IN -->&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<!-- WP Style End: IN -->\r\n(Rule 35) Correction or reduction of sentence--Time permitted--Post-conviction\r\nremedies unimpaired.\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style Off: B --><!-- WP Style End: B -->\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style On: B --><!-- WP Style End: B -->\r\n<a href=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=23A-31-2\">23A-31-2</a>\r\n<!-- WP Style Open: IN -->&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<!-- WP Style End: IN -->\r\n(Rule 36) Correction of clerical mistakes.\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style Off: B --><!-- WP Style End: B -->\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style On: B --><!-- WP Style End: B -->\r\n<a href=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=23A-31-3\">23A-31-3</a>\r\n<!-- WP Style Open: IN -->&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<!-- WP Style End: IN -->\r\nReduction of sentence for substantial assistance in investigating or prosecuting\r\nanother.\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style Off: B --><!-- WP Style End: B -->\r\n<p>\r\n</p></div></div></body>\r\n</html>\r\n<hr><br><html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title></title><meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"PowerTools for Open XML\"><style>span { white-space: pre-wrap; }\r\np.s2048997Normal {\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: .001pt;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048997SENU {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048997CL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\np.s2048997Normal-000000 {\r\n    text-indent: 0.50in;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: .001pt;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048997DefaultParagraphFont {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\np.s2048997Normal-000001 {\r\n    margin-left: 0.70in;\r\n    text-indent: -0.45in;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: .001pt;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048997000002 {\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048997SCL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048997SCL-000003 {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\n</style></head><body><div style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif'; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1;\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048997Normal\"><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-31-1\"><span class=\"s2048997SENU\">23A-31-1</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2048997SENU\">. </span><span class=\"s2048997CL\">(Rule 35) Correction or reduction of sentence--Time permitted--Post-conviction remedies unimpaired.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048997Normal-000000\"><span class=\"s2048997DefaultParagraphFont\">A court may correct an illegal sentence at any time and may correct a sentence imposed in an illegal manner within the time provided in this section for the reduction of sentence. A court may reduce a sentence:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048997Normal-000001\"><span class=\"s2048997DefaultParagraphFont\">(1)    Within two years after the sentence is imposed;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048997Normal-000001\"><span class=\"s2048997DefaultParagraphFont\">(2)    Within one hundred twenty days after receipt by the court of a remittitur issued upon affirmance of the judgment or dismissal of the appeal; or</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048997Normal-000001\"><span class=\"s2048997DefaultParagraphFont\">(3)    Within one hundred twenty days after entry of any order or judgment of the Supreme Court denying review of, or having the effect of upholding, a judgment of conviction;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048997Normal\"><span class=\"s2048997DefaultParagraphFont\">whichever is later. A court may also reduce a sentence upon revocation of probation or suspension of sentence as provided by law. The remedies provided by this section are not a substitute for nor do they affect any remedies incident to post-conviction proceedings.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048997Normal\"><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2048997000002\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048997Normal\"><span class=\"s2048997SCL\">Source:</span><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2048997SCL-000003\"><span>  <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/SessionLaws/1978/178/null/null\" aria-label=\"SL 1978, ch 178\">SL 1978, ch 178</a>, § 384; <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/SessionLaws/2005/127/null/null\" aria-label=\"SL 2005, ch 127\">SL 2005, ch 127</a>, § 2.</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048997Normal\"><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2048997000002\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048997Normal\"><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2048997000002\"> </span></p></div></div></body></html><hr><br><html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title></title><meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"PowerTools for Open XML\"><style>span { white-space: pre-wrap; }\r\np.s2048998Normal {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048998SENU {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048998CL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\np.s2048998Normal-000000 {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-indent: 0.50in;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048998DefaultParagraphFont {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048998000001 {\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048998SCL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048998SCL-000002 {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\n</style></head><body><div style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif'; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1;\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048998Normal\"><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-31-2\"><span class=\"s2048998SENU\">23A-31-2</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2048998SENU\">. </span><span class=\"s2048998CL\">(Rule 36) Correction of clerical mistakes.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048998Normal-000000\"><span class=\"s2048998DefaultParagraphFont\">Clerical mistakes in judgments, orders, or other parts of a record and errors in a record arising from oversight or omission may be corrected by a court at any time and after such notice, if any, as the court orders.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048998Normal\"><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2048998000001\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048998Normal\"><span class=\"s2048998SCL\">Source:</span><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2048998SCL-000002\"><span>  <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/SessionLaws/1978/178/null/null\" aria-label=\"SL 1978, ch 178\">SL 1978, ch 178</a>, § 385.</span></span></p></div></div></body></html><hr><br><html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title></title><meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"PowerTools for Open XML\"><style>span { white-space: pre-wrap; }\r\np.s2048999Normal {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048999SENU {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048999CL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\np.s2048999Normal-000000 {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-indent: 0.50in;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048999DefaultParagraphFont {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\np.s2048999Normal-000001 {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-indent: 0.25in;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048999000002 {\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048999SCL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048999SCL-000003 {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\n</style></head><body><div style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif'; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1;\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048999Normal\"><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-31-3\"><span class=\"s2048999SENU\">23A-31-3</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2048999SENU\">. </span><span class=\"s2048999CL\">Reduction of sentence for substantial assistance in investigating or prosecuting another.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048999Normal-000000\"><span class=\"s2048999DefaultParagraphFont\">Upon the motion of the prosecuting attorney, the court may reduce a sentence if the defendant has provided substantial assistance in investigating or prosecuting another person.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048999Normal-000001\"><span class=\"s2048999DefaultParagraphFont\">Whenever granting a sentence reduction pursuant to this section, the court is not prohibited from reducing the sentence to a level below the minimum sentence provided in statute.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048999Normal\"><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2048999000002\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048999Normal\"><span class=\"s2048999SCL\">Source:</span><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2048999SCL-000003\"><span>  <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/SessionLaws/2009/125/null/null\" aria-label=\"SL 2009, ch 125\">SL 2009, ch 125</a>, § 1.</span></span></p></div></div></body></html></head></html>","Credits":null,"StatuteText":null,"Article":null,"Created":null,"CreatedById":null,"LastUpdated":null,"LastUpdatedBy":null,"Repealed":false,"StatuteReferencesReferencesStatute":[],"StatuteReferencesStatute":[]}